@startuml Kelola_Voucher_Admin
!theme plain
title Sequence Diagram: Kelola Voucher (Manage Vouchers) - Admin
actor Admin
participant "Mobile App\n(Flutter)" as App
participant "Backend\nAPI" as API
database "Database" as DB

Admin -> App: Login sebagai Admin
App -> App: Set Admin Session
App --> Admin: Tampilkan Admin Dashboard

Admin -> App: Klik Menu Kelola Voucher
App -> API: GET /api/admin/vouchers
API -> DB: Query All Vouchers
DB --> API: Return Voucher List
API --> App: Response JSON (Voucher List)
App --> Admin: Tampilkan Daftar Voucher\n(Code, Diskon, Expired Date, Usage Count, Status)

alt Buat Voucher Baru
    Admin -> App: Klik Tombol Buat Voucher
    App --> Admin: Tampilkan Form Create Voucher

    Admin -> App: Input Kode, Tipe Diskon (%), Nominal, Masa Berlaku, Min Purchase, Max Usage
    App -> App: Validasi Input (Kode Unik, Format Valid)

    alt Input Valid
        App -> API: POST /api/admin/vouchers
        note right of App
            Request Body:
            - code
            - discount_type (percentage/fixed)
            - discount_value
            - start_date
            - expiry_date
            - min_purchase
            - max_usage
            - max_usage_per_user
            - description
            - admin_id
        end note

        API -> DB: Check Voucher Code Uniqueness
        alt Code Not Exists
            API -> DB: Create New Voucher
            DB --> API: Success (Voucher ID Generated)
            API --> App: Response 201 (Voucher Created)
            App --> Admin: Tampilkan Success "Voucher berhasil dibuat"
            App -> API: GET /api/admin/vouchers
            API -> DB: Query Updated Voucher List
            DB --> API: Return List
            API --> App: Response Updated List
            App --> Admin: Refresh Daftar Voucher
        else Code Already Exists
            API --> App: Response 409
            App --> Admin: Tampilkan Error "Kode voucher sudah ada"
        end
    else Input Invalid
        App --> Admin: Tampilkan Error "Lengkapi semua field dengan benar"
    end

else Edit Voucher
    Admin -> App: Klik Salah Satu Voucher untuk Edit
    App -> API: GET /api/admin/vouchers/{voucher_id}
    API -> DB: Query Voucher Detail
    DB --> API: Return Voucher Data
    API --> App: Response Voucher Detail
    App --> Admin: Tampilkan Form Edit dengan Data Existing

    Admin -> App: Update Fields (Diskon, Masa Berlaku, Max Usage, dll)
    App -> App: Validasi Input

    alt Input Valid
        App -> API: PUT /api/admin/vouchers/{voucher_id}
        API -> DB: Update Voucher Record
        DB --> API: Success
        API --> App: Response 200 (Voucher Updated)
        App --> Admin: Tampilkan Success "Voucher berhasil diubah"
    else Input Invalid
        App --> Admin: Tampilkan Error "Data tidak valid"
    end

else Deactivate/Delete Voucher
    Admin -> App: Klik Tombol Deactivate/Delete
    App --> Admin: Tampilkan Confirmation Dialog

    Admin -> App: Confirm Delete
    App -> API: DELETE /api/admin/vouchers/{voucher_id}

    API -> DB: Check if Voucher Already Used
    alt Voucher Not Used Yet
        API -> DB: Delete Voucher Record
        DB --> API: Success
        API --> App: Response 200
        App --> Admin: Tampilkan Success "Voucher berhasil dihapus"
    else Voucher Already Used
        API -> DB: Mark Voucher as Inactive
        DB --> API: Success
        API --> App: Response 200 (Marked Inactive)
        App --> Admin: Tampilkan Success "Voucher dinonaktifkan\n(data riwayat tetap tersimpan)"
    end

    App -> API: GET /api/admin/vouchers
    API -> DB: Query Updated List
    DB --> API: Return List
    API --> App: Response Updated List
    App --> Admin: Refresh Daftar Voucher

else View Voucher Statistics
    Admin -> App: Klik Tab Statistik/Analytics
    App -> API: GET /api/admin/vouchers/{voucher_id}/stats
    note right of App
        Query Params:
        - date_range
        - status
    end note

    API -> DB: Query Voucher Usage Statistics
    DB --> API: Return (Times Used, Total Discount, Avg Discount Per Use)
    API --> App: Response Statistics
    App --> Admin: Tampilkan Statistik\n(Usage Count, Total Discount Given, Popular Vouchers)
end

@enduml
